nodes.body:
Hi @iyastreb, could you take a look at this PR? It adds an opt-in NIXL CPU-buffer transport for TDX/CC PD deployments, including Qwen3.5 KV cache and GDN state transfer. Given your recent work on hybrid-model state transfers in #44740, your feedback on host-buffer registration, descriptor handling, and bootstrap compatibility would be especially helpful.

@ShangmingCai, could you also review the abort/drain handling and deferred resource release across TP ranks?

Thanks!

